      "writtenOn": "2026-04-07T15:50:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I guess my question is mostly to @gavinmak@google.com -- I\u0027m not sure I understand the legacy use of the flag you mention. It looks like it was first added in the CL you linked, as a string value (the gerrit host). I don\u0027t see where it was previously a boolean?",
      "parentUuid": "bb1d40fb_60e72bca",
      "revId": "5332f27b3800c1e2b82b5c23903b599c3387f4d5",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
