      "writtenOn": "2026-04-10T18:32:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I found https://crrev.com/c/505267. FWIU it started as a host name, then git cl started looking at git remote to get the gerrit host which made the flag redundant, then git cl started using it to check whether gerrit was being used",
